course: dictionary
lesson: 11605
title: Applied: used in real life
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Applied is the past form of «apply». Apply can mean to use something or to ask for something. «She applied for a job at the library» means she asked for the job. «He applied sun cream before the beach» means he put the cream on his skin.
explain: Look at the words around applied to find its meaning. The words after it tell you what was used or asked for: a job, sun cream, a rule. To check, swap in a simple word like «used» or «put on» and see if the sentence still makes sense.
explain: Applied can also describe knowledge that is used for real, practical work, not just ideas in a book. «Applied maths» means maths used to solve real problems. The clue is the word next to it: maths, and the real problem it solves.
fact: Applied is the past form of apply.
fact: «Apply» can mean to put something on, such as «apply glue» or «apply paint».
fact: «Apply» can also mean to ask for something, such as «apply for a passport».
fact: «Applied» can describe knowledge used in practice, such as «applied science».
fact: In science, a force is applied to an object when it is pushed or pulled.
exercise: «She applied for a job at the library.» What does applied mean here? | *Asked for | Threw away | Sang loudly | Forgot
exercise: «He applied sun cream before the beach.» Find the word that is the past form of apply. | sun | before | *applied | beach
exercise: «Applied maths» means maths used for what? | Counting sheep at night | *Real, practical problems | Only for fun puzzles in a book
test: «We applied the rule to every answer.» What does applied mean here? | Sang loudly | Tore up | Ignored | *Used
test: Which is an example of applied science? | A story about a dragon | *Using science to design a safe bridge | A list of your favourite colours | A poem about the moon
exam: Ravi says applied always means happy. What is the best answer? | Yes, it always means happy | No, it means very large | Yes, because it sounds like apple | *No, it can mean used or asked for, so check the clue words
